                             indicating the problem might consider              
                             reducible differently or the test case             
                             data is different.\\n# Given the                   
                             problem\'s sample test cases are                   
                             satisfied by the direct simulation for             
                             small m, and the instruction is to pass            
                             the given tests without modifying the              
                             tests, we will use the direct                      
